    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_9Kzg3KA9F3QnEFM",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID38",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "faithfulness_card_788ceea31789f4cd6d3549b7__openai_gpt-6_1-sol",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<strong>Paragraph</strong><br><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">5. SURVEYS AND ADMINISTRATIVE DATA SOURCES (1–2 pages) &gt; Cyber harassment\n\nComponents:\n\nUnwanted sexually explicit emails or text (or online) messages;\n Inappropriate or offensive advances on social networking websites or internet chat rooms;\n Threats of physical and/or sexual violence by email or text (or online) message;\n Hate speech, meaning language that denigrates, insults, threatens or targets an individual based on her identity (gender) and other traits (e.g. sexual orientation or disability).\n\nSub-components:\n\nUse of force (use of threats / abuse of vulnerability, power, trust)\n Perpetrated by someone belonging to the intimate sphere (spouse, cohabiting partner, non-cohabiting partner, former spouse, ex partner, parents, between spouses or people who live together or have lived together, another member of the family, children, relatives, within the family or domestic unit, in her own home)</div><br><strong>Argument</strong><br><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">Cyber harassment includes threats of physical or sexual violence sent by email, text, or other online messages, as well as threatening language targeting a woman based on her gender or other identity traits. Relevant sub-components include the use of threats and abuse of vulnerability, power, or trust. Perpetrators may belong to a woman’s intimate or domestic sphere, including current or former partners and family members.</div><br><strong>How relevant is the argument to the paragraph?</strong>",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "faithfulness_card_788ceea31789f4cd6d3549b7__openai_gpt-6_1-sol",
        "QuestionType": "MC",
        "Selector": "SAVR",
        "SubSelector": "TX",
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        },
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "QuestionDescription": "faithfulness_card_788ceea31789f4cd6d3549b7__openai_gpt-6_1-sol",
        "Choices": {
          "1": {
            "Display": "0 - Not relevant"
          },
          "2": {
            "Display": "1 - Partially relevant"
          },
          "3": {
            "Display": "2 - Relevant"
          }
        },
        "ChoiceOrder": [
          "1",
          "2",
          "3"
        ],
        "Validation": {
