      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<strong>Paragraph</strong><br><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">A3.5. Online gender-based hate speech: common components at national level\n\n</div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr><th colspan=\"9\">ONLINE GENDER-BASED HATE SPEECH</th></tr>\n<tr><th></th><th colspan=\"3\">TYPE OF CONDUCT</th><th colspan=\"5\">VARIABLES</th></tr>\n<tr><th>Member State</th><th>Incitement to violence, hatred, discrimination, commission of crime</th><th>Calumny, defamation, insults</th><th>Sexism</th><th>By ICT means, any other means or in public</th><th>Gender (on grounds of gender)</th><th>Repeated over time</th><th>Intentional act</th><th>Effects on victim (harm the victim)</th></tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>Belgium</td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Bulgaria</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Czechia</td><td>X</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Denmark</td><td>X</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Germany</td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Estonia</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Ireland</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td>X</td><td></td><td>X</td><td>X</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Greece</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td>X</td><td></td><td>X</td><td>X</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Spain</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>France</td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Croatia</td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Italy ()</td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Cyprus</td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Latvia</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Lithuania</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Luxembourg</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Hungary</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Malta ()</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Netherlands ()</td><td>X</td><td>X</td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Austria</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Poland</td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Portugal</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Romania</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Slovenia</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Slovakia</td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td>X</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Finland</td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Sweden</td><td>X</td><td>X</td><td></td><td>X</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><br><strong>Argument</strong><br><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">National components of online gender-based hate speech vary: some include calumny, defamation and insults as a conduct category, while others include sexism. Intentional acts and effects on victims are separately identified variables in some national entries. These categories do not establish whether casual use of woman-directed slurs without intent to attack women is covered.</div><br><strong>How relevant is the argument to the paragraph?</strong>",
