        "QuestionText": "<strong>Paragraph</strong><br><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">ALERT! &gt; ANTI-FEMINIST TACTICS AND NARRATIVES ONLINE\n\nTactics are the different methods of attack used by men’s groups to oppose\ngender equality. Narratives are the discourses they create and spread to discredit\nfeminists and promote a patriarchal agenda. The figure below shows the most\nprominent narratives and tactics used in the so-called manosphere globally. The\nresearch mentioned above found that online tactics are consistent with the tactics\noutlined in the sources below.\n\nTACTICS\n\nDEFLECT\n\nShifting the focus away from women’s rights issues\n\nDENY\n\nDenying the validity of gender equality and women’s rights issues\n\nDISCOUNT\n\nMinimizing the importance of gender equality and women’s rights issues\n\nTHREATEN\n\nThreatening to harm women and women’s rights activists\n\nFLIPPING THE NARRATIVE\n\nCountering feminist claims with opposing narratives (positively) centring on men\n\nDISCREDIT\n\nCasting doubts on the legitimacy, motives and methods of women’s rights activists\n\nDIVIDE\n\nDisrupting the unity between women’s rights activists\n\nNARRATIVES\n\nJUSTIFYING VIOLENCE AND\nHOSTILITY TOWARDS WOMEN !\n\nJUSTIFYING THE BELITTLING\nOF WOMEN\n\nPORTRAYING MEN AS VICTIMS\nOF GENDER EQUALITY\n\nJUSTIFYING THE EXCLUSION\nOF WOMEN\n\nPROMOTION OF PATRIARCHY AND\nMALE PRIVILEGE\n\nhttps://t.ly/MotxS Source: UN Women. 2021. ''Online Opposition to Gender Equality: Understanding opposition to gender equality and feminism in the virtual space''. Unpublished report.</div><br><strong>Argument</strong><br><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">Men’s groups and manosphere discourses use tactics such as deflecting from women’s rights issues, denying the validity of gender equality and women’s rights, minimizing their importance, flipping the narrative to centre men, and discrediting women’s rights activists. These tactics are paired with narratives that justify violence and hostility toward women, justify belittling women, portray men as victims of gender equality, justify the exclusion of women, and promote patriarchy and male privilege. Together, these patterns work to oppose gender equality, discredit feminists, and maintain a patriarchal agenda.</div><br><strong>How relevant is the argument to the paragraph?</strong>",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "faithfulness_card_34d3218fd1309168ba78b039__deepseek_deepseek-v4_1-flash-1017",
